From fc9355e07203f1d845ba926238013eaa8d354f3c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fengshuai <shuai.feng@sunmi.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:02:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 06/13] feat(sidebar-files): let a Files tab change root and
 drag entries out

Replaces the per-tab root node with an epoch-guarded tree so the displayed root can change without touching the Session cwd, and puts a canonical file-reference payload on every tree-row drag.

Repairs two gate findings while committing: the openTree root binding no longer uses a definite-assignment let, and long slot/guard lines are rewrapped under 140 columns. No behavior change.
